### ===== READ ROOMS (public) =====

### Get all rooms
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms

### Get one room (replace PASTE_ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/PASTE_ID

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?type=Double

### Filter by price range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?minPrice=100&maxPrice=200

### Filter by capacity (3 or more)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?capacity=3

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?search=ocean

### Sort by price, low to high
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?sort=price_asc

### Sort by price, high to low
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms?sort=price_desc

### Error: bad ID (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/123


### ===== ADMIN ROOM ACTIONS (need admin token) =====

### Create a room
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Test Room",
  "type": "Single",
  "pricePerNight": 50,
  "capacity": 1
}

### Update a room
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/PASTE_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

{ "pricePerNight": 300 }

### Delete a room
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/rooms/PASTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Error: invalid room type (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Test Room",
  "type": "Palace",
  "pricePerNight": 100,
  "capacity": 2
}

### Error: negative price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Test Room",
  "type": "Single",
  "pricePerNight": -50,
  "capacity": 1
}

### Error: create room with no token (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Room",
  "type": "Single",
  "pricePerNight": 50,
  "capacity": 1
}

### Error: create room as a guest (expect 403)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_GUEST_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Test Room",
  "type": "Single",
  "pricePerNight": 50,
  "capacity": 1
}


### ===== AUTH =====

### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Guest",
  "email": "guest@test.com",
  "password": "guest123"
}

### Error: duplicate email (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Guest",
  "email": "guest@test.com",
  "password": "guest123"
}

### Error: missing fields (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "x@test.com"
}

### Error: short password (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Short Pass",
  "email": "short@test.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest@test.com",
  "password": "guest123"
}

### Error: wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}

### Who am I
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN

### Error: invalid JSON (expect 400 "Invalid JSON in request body")
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": 

### Error: unknown route (expect 404 JSON message)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/nothing

### Error: invalid email at register (expect 400 "Please enter a valid email")
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Email",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "guest123"
}

### Error: room with empty body (expect 400 with readable messages)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN

{}